ćima</a></span></p>", "NAV Retail Price": "18399.000000", "NAV Price History": "16799.000000", "Položaj uređaja": "Horizontalni", "Dimenzije (ŠxVxD)": "99 x 44 cm", "NAV Sticker Ends At": "2026-03-21 00:00:00", "NAV Salesperson Code": "DEJANL", "NAV Sticker Starts At": "2026-03-19 00:00:00", "NAV ERP Product Status": "3", "NAV Category ID Description": "Radijatori"}', '2026-06-21 03:02:22.366560');
